{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012160/extras/b96fc327e94f815cd4e54ace149e1495.poster.avif?t=1758199014\" width=678 height=382 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012160/extras/b96fc327e94f815cd4e54ace149e1495.webm?t=1758199014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012160/extras/b96fc327e94f815cd4e54ace149e1495.mp4?t=1758199014\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of powerful helicopters and become a hero in the fight against devastating fires. Navigate through towering flames, refill your water tanks, and aim precisely to extinguish fires before they spread out of control. Work alongside fire trucks and brave crews to protect cities, forests, and wildlife from destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the thrill of tackling wildfires in different environments \u2013 from dense forests to urban areas \u2013 each with unique challenges and obstacles. Rescue trapped civilians, coordinate with other emergency teams, and plan your missions carefully to maximize your effectiveness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a variety of helicopters, each with distinct handling, speed, and water capacity. Upgrade your fleet and equipment as the difficulty increases, facing ever more intense and unpredictable fire scenarios.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mission is a test of skill, strategy, and courage. Protect nature, save lives, and rise to the challenge as the ultimate firefighting hero in this realistic and action-packed helicopter simulation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012160/extras/67f6bb6a05ab660624d1f2d9f9bce2b0.poster.avif?t=1758199014\" width=586 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012160/extras/67f6bb6a05ab660624d1f2d9f9bce2b0.webm?t=1758199014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012160/extras/67f6bb6a05ab660624d1f2d9f9bce2b0.mp4?t=1758199014\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4012160?t=1758199014","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012160/78d1940d73fd9ff3ce9a1bdbbbe714b7689fbe61/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758199014","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012160/234b3927e50952963821a7e2b005f4428705bcd5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758199014","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012160/234b3927e50952963821a7e2b005f4428705bcd5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758199014","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012160/extras/b96fc327e94f815cd4e54ace149e1495.poster.avif?t=1758199014\" width=678 height=382 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012160/extras/b96fc327e94f815cd4e54ace149e1495.webm?t=1758199014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><sou